                                                "sense_id": "f18cc4c8-5c68-35ba-bfa3-0c2f54de7758",
                                                "text": "Given a history of failed and unpopular solutions, the problem of concurrency has even been assigned its own numeronym: \"The C10K problem\". How should network software confidently serving 10,000 simultaneous clients be designed?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "016d04e8-7b23-46bd-ba78-7548bac8abd8",
                                                "sense_id": "f18cc4c8-5c68-35ba-bfa3-0c2f54de7758",
                                                "text": "Finally, the E7 countries—a numeronym standing for 'Emerging' market economies—include the BRIC countries, along with Indonesia, Mexico, and Turkey."
                                            }
